      "content": "Thank you for your patience. We are pleased to announce the release date of the next major update (ver 0.12.0).\n\nUpdate Date 2024/10/5 night (time to be determined)\n\nUpdate Details\n New Elements \n- An additional dungeon \"Reverberating Nightmare\" will be implemented, which can be played after clearing the main scenario!\n\nChanged elements\n - Major revision of blessed equipment\n - Base damage enhancement of various skills\n - Enhancement of various synergies and enhancements\n - Enhancement of various equipment\n - Various other changes\n\nThe developers will explain the above updates in the following schedule. \nAfternoon of 10/5/2024 (time TBD) \nhttps://www.twitch.tv/suzuki_suzuzou"
    },
